      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The author reviews 15 cases of ankle arthroscopy in adolescent patients. Most of the patients were female. He discusses the various pathologies identified, with the most common being a medial impingement lesion. Synovitis was present in all cases of persistent discomfort."},
